  <h2>Overview</h2>
  <p>This website — berlindisch.co — is a static informational and editorial site operated by Berlindisch, an informal cultural and media collective based in Berlin, Germany.</p>
  <p>We take privacy seriously and have deliberately designed this site to minimize data collection.</p>

  <h2 style="margin-top: 2rem;">What This Site Does Not Do</h2>
  <p>This site currently does not intentionally use tracking or advertising cookies.</p>
  <p>Specifically, this site does not:</p>
  <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-top: 0.75rem;">
    <li style="color: var(--color-muted); padding: 0.2rem 0;"><span style="color: var(--color-rose);">→ </span>use analytics tools (no Google Analytics, Plausible, Matomo, or similar)</li>
    <li style="color: var(--color-muted); padding: 0.2rem 0;"><span style="color: var(--color-rose);">→ </span>set tracking or marketing cookies</li>
    <li style="color: var(--color-muted); padding: 0.2rem 0;"><span style="color: var(--color-rose);">→ </span>use advertising or retargeting pixels</li>
    <li style="color: var(--color-muted); padding: 0.2rem 0;"><span style="color: var(--color-rose);">→ </span>embed third-party social media widgets or trackers</li>
    <li style="color: var(--color-muted); padding: 0.2rem 0;"><span style="color: var(--color-rose);">→ </span>load external fonts or scripts from third-party servers</li>
    <li style="color: var(--color-muted); padding: 0.2rem 0;"><span style="color: var(--color-rose);">→ </span>collect personal data through forms or user accounts</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 style="margin-top: 2rem;">Hosting &amp; Server Logs</h2>
  <p>This site is hosted on GitHub Pages. When you visit, the hosting provider may automatically collect and store technical information in server logs, including:</p>
  <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-top: 0.75rem;">
    <li style="color: var(--color-muted); padding: 0.2rem 0;"><span style="color: var(--color-rose);">→ </span>your IP address</li>
    <li style="color: var(--color-muted); padding: 0.2rem 0;"><span style="color: var(--color-rose);">→ </span>browser type and version</li>
    <li style="color: var(--color-muted); padding: 0.2rem 0;"><span style="color: var(--color-rose);">→ </span>date and time of access</li>
    <li style="color: var(--color-muted); padding: 0.2rem 0;"><span style="color: var(--color-rose);">→ </span>pages visited</li>
  </ul>
  <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">This data is collected by the hosting infrastructure, not by us. We do not have direct access to these logs. For more information, see <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub's Privacy Statement</a>.</p>

  <h2 style="margin-top: 2rem;">Email Contact</h2>
  <p>This site provides contact via <code>mailto:</code> links. If you send us an email, you voluntarily share your email address and message content with us. We will use this information only to respond to your inquiry and will not share it with third parties.</p>

  <h2 style="margin-top: 2rem;">External Links</h2>
  <p>This site may contain links to external websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those sites. We recommend reviewing their privacy policies independently.</p>

  <h2 style="margin-top: 2rem;">Your Rights</h2>
  <p>Under the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), you have the right to access, correct, delete, or restrict the processing of any personal data we may hold. Given the minimal data footprint of this site, this is unlikely to apply in practice.</p>
  <p>If you have questions or concerns, contact us at <a href="mailto:ahoi@berlindisch.co">ahoi@berlindisch.co</a>.</p>

  <h2 style="margin-top: 2rem;">Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>This policy may evolve as the Berlindisch collective grows and its activities expand. Any significant changes will be reflected on this page.</p>

  <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-surface); margin: 2rem 0;">
  <p style="font-size: 0.9rem;">This policy was last updated in May 2026.</p>

